From 9986083955754c072bd08fc6b9bab28e9ed9bc99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 02:09:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 46/56] Battle speed option, release number in Options,
 Nuzlocke tracker

- Options > BATTLE SPEED (FAST by default): HP bars drain about one
  pixel a frame, Exp. bars fill twice as fast, and battle message pauses
  are halved. NORMAL keeps vanilla timing.
- The Options header shows the release (include/hack_version.h).
- Start menu > NUZLOCKE (while the mode is on): each used area with its
  catch (by met location) and whether it's in the party, PC, fainted or
  missed. The Start menu packs 8 entries 13px apart to stay in the frame.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
